{"file": "我李长生重回八零，赶山狩猎养妻女-第57集.mp4", "ep": 57, "duration": 50.2, "segments": [{"start": 0.62, "end": 1.82, "text": "兩萬塊現金"}, {"start": 2.06, "end": 2.62, "text": "李爺"}, {"start": 2.9, "end": 3.5, "text": "兩萬"}, {"start": 3.94, "end": 5.1, "text": "就買這一根鬚"}, {"start": 5.62, "end": 8.87, "text": "錢我只要一萬"}, {"start": 9.27, "end": 11.01, "text": "那剩下的一萬呢"}, {"start": 12.45, "end": 13.13, "text": "換東西"}, {"start": 13.82, "end": 14.42, "text": "紅磚"}, {"start": 14.54, "end": 15.34, "text": "彪浩水泥"}, {"start": 15.34, "end": 15.94, "text": "羅文剛"}, {"start": 16.14, "end": 16.74, "text": "再給我弄齊"}, {"start": 16.74, "end": 17.94, "text": "線裡批鑒材的條子"}, {"start": 20.03, "end": 20.55, "text": "李爺"}, {"start": 20.83, "end": 22.23, "text": "您這是準備蓋公館啊"}, {"start": 22.67, "end": 23.31, "text": "能不能辦"}, {"start": 23.71, "end": 24.23, "text": "能"}, {"start": 24.59, "end": 25.11, "text": "明早"}, {"start": 25.31, "end": 25.87, "text": "現金"}, {"start": 25.87, "end": 26.71, "text": "鑒材條子"}, {"start": 26.71, "end": 27.67, "text": "一樣不少送到"}, {"start": 28.23, "end": 28.71, "text": "拿走"}, {"start": 37.54, "end": 38.02, "text": "李爺"}, {"start": 38.02, "end": 38.7, "text": "東西齊了"}, {"start": 39.14, "end": 39.82, "text": "條子在裡面"}, {"start": 39.94, "end": 40.86, "text": "還有一萬塊現金"}, {"start": 42.87, "end": 43.35, "text": "謝車"}, {"start": 45.87, "end": 46.43, "text": "廠商"}, {"start": 46.91, "end": 47.55, "text": "你這是"}, {"start": 47.83, "end": 48.99, "text": "真準備起大瓦房"}, {"start": 49.27, "end": 50.19, "text": "破誤該換了"}]}